{"text": "July 27, 1959\n\nMessrs. \u00a5ade Burgard\nFinch Crume\nQuick Goodson\nTatum\n\nRe; Tar Content Testing of Competitive Brands\n\nPlease refer to my memorandum dated July 23 under the\nabove title.\n\nMy list of the brands to be tested (paragraph numbered 3))\nonce every two weeks ahould be amended by deleting therefrom:\n\nA new category should be set-up to provide for immediate\ntesting of any and all new brands as they appear on the market.\nAfter an initial testing of such brand or brands, it will be\ndecided whether they should be kept on a frequent-testing schedule,\n\nAY/18\n\n226022089", "words": [{"text": "July", "x0": 518, "y0": 235, "x1": 555, "y1": 249, "conf": 68.0}, {"text": "27,", "x0": 565, "y0": 235, "x1": 589, "y1": 248, "conf": 94.0}, {"text": "1959", "x0": 602, "y0": 234, "x1": 637, "y1": 246, "conf": 96.0}, {"text": "Messrs.", "x0": 110, "y0": 341, "x1": 172, "y1": 353, "conf": 15.0}, {"text": "\u00a5ade", "x0": 184, "y0": 341, "x1": 220, "y1": 353, "conf": 17.0}, {"text": "Burgard", "x0": 329, "y0": 342, "x1": 393, "y1": 356, "conf": 91.0}, {"text": "Finch", "x0": 183, "y0": 347, "x1": 231, "y1": 378, "conf": 68.0}, {"text": "Crume", "x0": 329, "y0": 357, "x1": 374, "y1": 369, "conf": 48.0}, {"text": "Quick", "x0": 180, "y0": 362, "x1": 229, "y1": 394, "conf": 94.0}, {"text": "Goodson", "x0": 328, "y0": 372, "x1": 393, "y1": 384, "conf": 96.0}, {"text": "Tatum", "x0": 328, "y0": 387, "x1": 375, "y1": 399, "conf": 19.0}, {"text": "Re;", "x0": 183, "y0": 434, "x1": 208, "y1": 446, "conf": 95.0}, {"text": "Tar", "x0": 228, "y0": 434, "x1": 256, "y1": 449, "conf": 43.0}, {"text": "Content", "x0": 265, "y0": 433, "x1": 328, "y1": 445, "conf": 43.0}, {"text": "Testing", "x0": 337, "y0": 434, "x1": 402, "y1": 449, "conf": 96.0}, {"text": "of", "x0": 410, "y0": 433, "x1": 428, "y1": 445, "conf": 97.0}, {"text": "Competitive", "x0": 438, "y0": 433, "x1": 537, "y1": 449, "conf": 96.0}, {"text": "Brands", "x0": 547, "y0": 434, "x1": 600, "y1": 4